decision_conditions:
Condition : 7 - The illuminated advertisement hereby approved shall comply with the following terms:
(a) Between the hours of sunset and 23:00, the intensity of the illumination of the LCD touchscreen display advertisement shall not exceed 2500 cd/m2 and the LED digital (building) identification advertisements shall not exceed 5500 cd/m2;
(b) Between the hours of 23:00 and sunrise, the intensity of the illumination of the LCD touchscreen display advertisement shall not exceed 2500 cd/m2 and the LED digital (building) identification advertisements shall not exceed 5500 cd/m2; 
(c) The advertisement shall be fitted with a light intensity monitoring censor to ensure the illuminance intensity is dimmable to take account of ambient light conditions and comply with the maximum recommended lighting intensity;
(d) The advertisement shall not display any moving, or apparently moving, images;
(e) Any change in the advertisement display shall be instantaneous;
(f) The advertisements displayed shall not change more frequently than once every 10 seconds.

Reason: In the interests of amenity and highway safety.
